  "retake": "Re-take only when a DELTA itself changed after `npm run data` (a book number that moves both twins never changes a delta). Never on a newer engine: that would bake its own numbers in. Make a worktree at this header's engineCommit (git worktree add <dir> <engineCommit>), copy the CURRENT scripts/blocks-parity-snapshot.mjs and scripts/lib/heavy-lock.mjs plus the new public/core.json, public/core-descriptions.json and the re-stamped src/data/trust-ledger.json (the trust gate reads it) into it, run `npx jiti scripts/blocks-parity-snapshot.mjs --write-fixture` there (no --allow-dirty: the copied ledger is data, not engine), and copy test/fixtures/tweaks-legacy-before.json back."
 },
